{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隔了一天休息，終於來到公佈考試結果的日子。", "text_idx": 499, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家一早就去看公佈欄上張貼的成績排名，不過……", "text_idx": 461, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊～啊啊啊～啊……啊……」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sn0226", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "進教室前我聽見奇妙的聲音。", "text_idx": 496, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我該打開這扇門嗎？還是離開比較好……", "text_idx": 473, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊～欸～哇～真的假的～啊啊啊還可以吧……啊～」", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sn0227", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊～安潔也好幸福～能讓妳喜歡安潔好開心～～」", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0718", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好，開吧。", "text_idx": 464, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一進教室，我看到安潔在幫大家按摩肩膀。", "text_idx": 452, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "乾同學成為第一個試驗品，她從剛才開始就發出舒服的呻吟聲。", "text_idx": 455, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到她這個模樣，考試結果什麼的，好像都不重要了。", "text_idx": 484, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那接下來是櫻乃學妹～」", "text_idx": 445, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0719", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……嗯、嗯、安潔、太用力了、嗯。」", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "sk0680", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽學姊也請坐請坐。」", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0720", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊……嗯呼、嗯、小菜夏真厲害……」", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "mu0325", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「最後壓軸當然是愛理同學也要～」", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0721", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、啊、那裡不行……嗯唔……再溫柔、嗯嗯、一點啦、嗯嗯……」", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "ar3749", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯、嗯、嗯、啊啊、那裡……那裡、好棒……啊啊……嗯……嗯……」", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "ar3750", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只有愛理按這麼久？」", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sn0228", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為愛理同學是年級第一名呀～」", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0722", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，原來有關連……」", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "順帶一提，在瀨名同學家的用功發揮了效果，全員都考到比預期中更好的成績。", "text_idx": 502, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學還是不變的年級第一名。安潔的肩膀按摩似乎就是獎勵的樣子。", "text_idx": 482, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這次就只有幫女生們按摩，請男生們多多包涵喔～」", "text_idx": 439, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0723", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯我不用啦……」", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然在旁邊看到有點心跳加速……", "text_idx": 501, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太，你看完考試結果後跑到哪裡去了？結果我一個人獨占這個場面了喔……", "text_idx": 500, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "先不提我內心的騷動，安潔繼續按摩著肩膀。", "text_idx": 457, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理同學，按摩按摩按摩～」", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0724", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊啊啊……！」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "ar3751", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理好像很舒服……」", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "sk0681", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為最近肩膀很僵硬……啊啊啊……有、有認真念書太好了……！」", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "ar3752", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕～嚕～」", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": "pn0098", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？小熊喵也想被按摩嗎？」", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "mu0326", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我來按吧♪」", "text_idx": 443, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "mu0327", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕、嚕～嗚嚕嗚嗚～」", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": "pn0099", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這裡嗎？這裡舒服吧～」", "text_idx": 440, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0725", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊那裡……嗯嗯……嗯嗯嗯……」", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "ar3753", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗚嚕……嗚嚕嗚嗚……」", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": "pn0100", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "神秘的合奏開始了，我覺得自己真的把考試結果都忘光了。", "text_idx": 486, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈嘿……♪」", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "ar3754", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔喔喔，愛理昇天了呢……」", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sn0229", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「櫻乃覺得怎麼樣？」", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……感覺肩膀變輕了。」", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "sk0682", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「現在的話好像１００公尺可以跑出１０秒內。」", "text_idx": 427, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "sk0683", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那跟肩膀輕不輕沒有關係吧。」", "text_idx": 446, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵呵，安潔的女僕按摩好像大受好評呢！」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0726", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有一部分人評價太好，魂都飛了……」", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我第一次看到這麼軟趴趴的瀨名同學……", "text_idx": 472, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不過安潔也辛苦了。按摩這麼多人很累吧？」", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不會不會，這點小事沒什麼，反而希望大家讓安潔多按一下呢！」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0727", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，那安潔也幫我按吧～」", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "結女學生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "ja0055", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也要我也要！」", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "各務台女生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 459, "voice": "sb0047", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好～那就下一節下課時間來按吧！」", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0728", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到那樣的反應大家都坐不住了，安潔的按摩立刻就排滿了預約。", "text_idx": 485, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「與其說女僕其實更像按摩店了呢……」", "text_idx": 434, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵呵，小菜夏很厲害的，沒問題喔。」", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "mu0328", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是為什麼要突然按摩呢？還變成了按摩女僕。」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "mu0329", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "聽到天羽學姊的疑問，安潔開心雀躍地笑了。", "text_idx": 492, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為安潔先前被新吾同學的手指技巧弄得酥酥軟軟了！」", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0729", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……這句爆炸性發言讓整個教室一口氣哄然騷動。", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「接下來……」", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥。」", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "sk0684", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，櫻乃。」", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "放學後，當我想著接下來要做什麼時候，在走廊上遇到了櫻乃。", "text_idx": 475, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今天也辛苦了。」", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒事嗎？」", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "sk0685", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？什麼？」", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「被哥哥的手指技巧弄得酥酥軟軟那句話。」", "text_idx": 436, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "sk0686", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊……那個喔。」", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那句爆炸性發言後鐘聲就響了，所以櫻乃和天羽學姊都趕緊回去各自的教室……", "text_idx": 498, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔的確是變得酥酥軟軟呢……」", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什什什什麼……！？」", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sn0230", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀真是的～別說了啦新吾同學……」", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0730", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「混帳瓜生～～！你！你對安潔伸出了魔爪嗎～！？」", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sn0231", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「下次肩膀再僵硬的話我還會幫妳按摩的，安潔。」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸嘿嘿，謝謝你。」", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0731", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……咦……肩膀？」", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sn0232", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，之前我稍微幫安潔按摩了一下肩膀。」", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為被按摩的感覺很好，所以安潔今天才會想幫大家按摩。」", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0732", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「然、後、啊……呵呵呵～小紗同學妳真是的♪」", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0733", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔咿咿……」", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sn0233", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不要說那種容易讓人誤會的話啦，安潔！可惡，妳乾脆被瓜生那種混帳出手算了！」", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sn0234", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……其實冷靜一想，「我按摩安潔肩膀」這件事本身就很那個了。", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過多虧了我故意搞笑，這部分就被忽視了。", "text_idx": 453, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「畢竟在這種環境生活了一個月，我也熟悉應付這種場合的方法了啊……」", "text_idx": 429, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真可怕。」", "text_idx": 431, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "sk0687", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們兄妹兩人連連點頭感嘆。", "text_idx": 470, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我跟櫻乃走向校舍的大門。", "text_idx": 474, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔的肩膀，是星期日？」", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "sk0688", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯，因為安潔果然在努力工作。」", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安潔是因為被我按摩後很高興，所以才會也想幫大家按摩的吧。", "text_idx": 466, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "身為起因的我，內心有點不好意思。", "text_idx": 494, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔……」", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "sk0689", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……回去後也幫櫻乃按摩肩膀吧？」", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "感覺不這麼說的話好像很尷尬，所以我盡可能讓自己自然而然地問。", "text_idx": 469, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「應該說，是我想按。」", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好。」", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "sk0690", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "櫻乃果然立刻就點頭了。", "text_idx": 480, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我喜歡葛格的按摩。安潔會酥酥軟軟也不是沒有道理。」", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "sk0691", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不過那個安潔也讓大家都酥酥軟軟了……」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔跟葛格不一樣。回家後也讓我酥酥軟軟吧。」", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "sk0692", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好好好。」", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "還好現在附近只有我們兩人，她這句話似乎比安潔的爆炸性發言更會引發軒然大波。", "text_idx": 497, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那就快點回家吧。」", "text_idx": 442, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "sk0693", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「說的也是，直接回家吧。」", "text_idx": 438, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「用跑的回家。」", "text_idx": 428, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "sk0694", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「櫻乃，那樣到家前就沒體力了……」", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「？」", "text_idx": 447, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "sk0695", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「地上有垃圾。」", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "被揉成一團的紙張掉在地上，我撿了起來。", "text_idx": 493, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼啊！？」", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0734", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "轉頭看向聲音來源，走廊的另一頭出現安潔的身影。", "text_idx": 495, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她提著裙襬跑過來。", "text_idx": 463, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「被搶先了～安潔明明跟兩位同一時間注意到垃圾的說～」", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0735", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳想撿嗎？」", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "sk0696", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「當然了，安潔要撿一大堆垃圾。校園內的整潔是安潔的驕傲喔！」", "text_idx": 430, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0736", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一定是這份驕傲維持著校內的環境美化吧。", "text_idx": 451, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為結女的校園中，即使是班級掃地區域以外的地方也這麼乾淨。", "text_idx": 460, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是這次卻被新吾同學搶先了。啊哈哈，安潔太丟臉了呢。」", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0737", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯～那……」", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「傳球！」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我喊了一聲把垃圾拋了出去。", "text_idx": 471, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「汪汪！」", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0738", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安潔的裙襬飄起，華麗地接住了。", "text_idx": 467, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「然後立刻奔回本壘！」", "text_idx": 425, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0739", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好球！」", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不可以拿垃圾來玩啦～」", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0740", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，彼此彼此。那就麻煩妳拿去垃圾桶丟了。」", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「遵命！欸嘿嘿，那兩位請慢走喔～」", "text_idx": 441, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ag0741", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最後還是收下了我撿起的垃圾，安潔可愛地行禮後離開了。", "text_idx": 477, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我們也走吧，當然是用走的不要跑。」", "text_idx": 444, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "sk0697", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「？」", "text_idx": 447, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "櫻乃歪著頭，一直盯著我看。", "text_idx": 481, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真稀奇。」", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "sk0698", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔？」", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥。」", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "sk0699", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大概是因為剛才安潔在，所以「葛格」變成「哥哥」了。", "text_idx": 462, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「居然會像那樣跟女孩子玩鬧。」", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "sk0700", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……是嗎？我覺得是很普通的玩笑啊。」", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒有像那樣。」", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "sk0701", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「特別是對結女的女孩子。」", "text_idx": 426, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "sk0702", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……這樣啊。」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過，的確……", "text_idx": 454, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 147, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "儘管與一開始相比相處的氣氛變好許多，但對瀨名同學、天羽學姊、乾同學就沒辦法像那樣玩鬧。", "text_idx": 456, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 148, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為是安潔嘛。」", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 149, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "結論就是這樣。", "text_idx": 490, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 150, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為她是這樣的女孩。安潔在結女的女孩中是最讓人容易親近的。」", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 151, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "sk0703", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 152, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「葛格。」", "text_idx": 435, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "sk0704", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 153, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 154, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「回家後按摩我的肩膀。」", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "sk0705", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 155, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，好好好，走吧。」", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 156, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。」", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "sk0706", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
